<main id="main-content" class="world-page love-page"><section class="world-hero ghx-wrap" aria-labelledby="love-title"><div class="love-hero-inner"><p class="ghx-kicker">The relationship behind the work</p><h1 id="love-title">The Woman<br/>Behind the Scenes.</h1><p class="world-lead">She saw the heart beneath the scars and never asked it to hide.</p><p>Her love helped shape the man he is today.</p></div></section>
<section class="world-prose ghx-wrap" aria-labelledby="love-stayed-title"><div class="world-section-label">A story already present in the songs</div><div class="world-prose-grid"><div><h2 id="love-stayed-title">Love stayed. The story changed.</h2></div><div class="world-reading"><p>The songs speak of finding love in the ashes, choosing each other through every battle, and building something real when the world gives you reasons to break.</p><p>Being loved did not erase his past. It gave him a reason to believe his heart could still carry purpose. GhostHeart may have been shaped by pain, but her love helped turn that pain toward purpose.</p><blockquote>I got you for life.</blockquote><p>This is one public glimpse of that relationship. The rest belongs to the people living it.</p></div></div></section>
